AMIX (SVR4.0 on the 68060): no threads, no C11 atomics, gettimeofday for
the clock (as DJGPP); localtime_r/gmtime_r from localtime/gmtime and no
tm_gmtoff; in quickjs-libc (qjs's std and os modules) what POSIX added after
1991, built from the calls AMIX has: setenv/unsetenv (putenv, environ),
nanosleep (poll), getrusage (times), mkstemp/mkdtemp (mktemp), utimes
(utime), sighandler_t, RTLD_LOCAL, struct timespec; os.exec without
closefrom.

